# Configuration

Configuration is loaded from `config/base.env` with optional overrides in `config/.env`.

## Model Configuration

```bash
# Fast model for quick tasks (topic suggestion, JSON conversion, section extraction)
LLM_MODEL_FAST=qwen3:8b

# Article model for generation (summarization, article content, section merging)
LLM_MODEL_ARTICLE=deepseek-r1:14b

# Enable thinking mode for supported models (qwen3, deepseek-r1)
LLM_THINK_MODE=true
```

## Run Profiles

```bash
RUN_PROFILE=test   # Fast iteration: 1 topic, fewer sources
RUN_PROFILE=prod   # Full fidelity: 10 topics, more sources
```

## Topic Processing

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `TOPIC_PROCESSING_ITERATIONS` | 10 | Iterations per claimed topic |
| `IMPROVEMENTS_PER_NEW_ARTICLE` | 10 | Improvement passes after creating new article |
| `CREATE_PR_AFTER_ITERATIONS` | false | Create PR when done (or just commit to branch) |
| `AUTO_MERGE_READY_PRS` | false | Auto-merge approved PRs at run start |
| `MAX_TOPICS_PER_RUN` | 10 | Topics processed per run |
| `LOOP_INTERVAL_SECONDS` | 60 | Delay between runs |

## Search & Source Settings

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `PHASE1_TARGET_SOURCES` | 20 | Target sources to gather per topic |
| `PHASE1_SEARCH_NUM_QUERIES` | 10 | Different search queries per topic |
| `TARGET_SUMMARIES_PER_QUERY` | 5 | Summaries to collect per search query |
| `SOURCE_SUMMARY_MIN_WORDS` | 200 | Minimum words for valid source summary |
| `SEARCH_MAX_CHARS` | 200000 | Max chars of page text before summarization |
| `SEARCH_RESULTS_PER_QUERY` | 20 | Search results per query |
| `SEARCH_MAX_FETCH_CONCURRENCY` | 3 | Concurrent headless browser fetches |

## PR Monitoring

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `PR_POLL_INTERVAL_SECONDS` | 30 | How often to poll PR status |
| `PR_MAX_WAIT_MINUTES` | 30 | Max time to wait for PR ready |
| `MAX_CONCURRENT_PRS` | 1 | Maximum simultaneous open PRs |

## Knowledge-Base Integration

```bash
USE_KNOWLEDGE_BASE=false
KB_API_URL=http://localhost:8081
```

## Debug Mode

```bash
RESEARCH_DEBUG_SOURCES=true  # Save raw pages and LLM outputs to _debug/
```
